ty }\\frac{1}{(2n-1)^{2}} & =\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}}{8}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402285 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402286 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402285 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402287 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402285 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402288 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402285 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402289 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402285 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402285 #edb/ref 1077 "field-1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402285 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186402287 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402285 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "bc21dfac-bf45-5494-902e-e23a4ab50c43" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402286 #edb/ref 1080 "(-1)^{n+1}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402286 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402286 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "e8731841-813d-5c15-9844-bc300aded01c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402287 #edb/ref 1080 "1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402287 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402287 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "7d76bc51-9148-5c68-8eea-0c61f6eca229" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402288 #edb/ref 1080 "0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402288 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402288 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "4b83a754-c4bd-58d7-824f-3b576edd0dbf" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402289 #edb/ref 1080 "(-1)^{n}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402289 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402289 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "152ee5ab-ddc5-54e1-abb5-85e05ecbc24d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402290 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402291 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402290 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402292 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402290 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402293 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402290 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402294 #edb/